-- Trimmed test fixture data for the local docker dev/test stack.
--
-- Seeds just enough of a real game world to exercise every selenium test
-- without skipping for missing data: the Galaxy master record and Space
-- sector tiles (unmodified), every planet's base definition row, and one
-- planet (Arland) with its full surface-tile grid and interest points
-- (including a Domain and a Dungeon, which TestInterestsDomain/Dungeon
-- specifically look for). Other planets' per-tile AreasX/Interests data is
-- omitted to keep this file small — their base config rows are enough for
-- the generic galaxy.php page-structure tests.
--
-- ShowAreas/ShowInterests are set to 1 so anonymous (non-DM) requests can
-- see map tiles and interest links, since the selenium tests don't log in
-- as DM. Source: trimmed down from a production pwdata dump on 2026-11-06.

